# Git submodules — currently empty.
#
# Vendored C++ dependencies (nlohmann/json, MinHook, ...) and the
# IL2CPP / BepInEx / Mono reference repos are cloned by `sync_vendor.ps1`
# into `dll/vendor/<name>/` and `vendor/<name>/` respectively, both
# ignored by .gitignore. Run that script when you want to refresh the
# upstream sources. Submodules were avoided because every clone of this
# repo would otherwise drag down 150+ MB of nlohmann history through
# `--recurse-submodules`.
